5070
04:16:01,130 --> 04:16:08,530
Getting shot, getting shot, getting shot, getting shot! Hang in there, hang in there!

5071
04:16:09,330 --> 04:16:13,450
Whoa, the world is spinning and spinning!

5072
04:16:13,450 --> 04:16:16,150
We're moving forward!

5073
04:16:16,150 --> 04:16:21,750
Alright, that was easy! Without the turrets, it's so much easier.

5074
04:16:21,750 --> 04:16:27,380
Now what? Is it okay to fall here?

5075
04:16:27,380 --> 04:16:32,460
Falling is fine for now.

5076
04:16:32,460 --> 04:16:37,350
Where does this go? Just back? The doors don't open or anything.

5077
04:16:37,550 --> 04:16:39,830
What?

5078
04:16:39,830 --> 04:16:42,110
Maybe the order changes? I can't see the goal at all.

5079
04:16:42,110 --> 04:16:47,470
Wait, there's something here, but is this it?

5080
04:16:47,470 --> 04:16:48,710
Huh?

5081
04:16:48,710 --> 04:16:50,710
That white wall over there?

5082
04:16:50,710 --> 04:16:54,610
Aaaaaaaah!

5083
04:16:54,610 --> 04:16:57,530
It's not like I'm falling.

5084
04:16:57,530 --> 04:16:59,990
Was there something?

5085
04:16:59,990 --> 04:17:02,890
I have no idea which one is the goal.

5086
04:17:02,890 --> 04:17:05,790
Oh, you're right! Something— Ahhh!!

5087
04:17:05,790 --> 04:17:07,590
That was close, close, close, close, close, close, close!

5088
04:17:07,590 --> 04:17:09,580
Yeah, there is something.

5089
04:17:09,580 --> 04:17:17,190
There's a white wall, but...

5090
04:17:17,190 --> 04:17:19,990
Is this the white wall?

5091
04:17:19,990 --> 04:17:22,290
There are a lot of them around here.

5092
04:17:22,290 --> 04:17:24,990
Is this white wall not the right one?

5093
04:17:24,990 --> 04:17:29,420
Anyway, there's one here and here, but...

5094
04:17:29,420 --> 04:17:31,190
Huh?

5095
04:17:31,190 --> 04:17:34,390
This is where I came from, right?

5096
04:17:34,390 --> 04:17:36,130
If you think about it normally...

5097
04:17:36,130 --> 04:17:39,070
Did it come from that direction?

5098
04:17:39,070 --> 04:17:43,270
So how do I get to the next area then?

5099
04:17:43,270 --> 04:17:44,070
Huh?

5100
04:17:44,070 --> 04:17:45,450
So this is the goal?

5101
04:17:45,450 --> 04:17:49,130
Oh, this is the entrance area.

5102
04:17:49,130 --> 04:17:55,320
Wait, what's that thing here?

5103
04:17:55,320 --> 04:17:58,160
Does it look like it'll swing open?

5104
04:17:58,160 --> 04:18:01,500
Wait, is this not a wall?

5105
04:18:01,500 --> 04:18:04,380
If you press something it opens?

5106
04:18:04,380 --> 04:18:07,140
I kind of get that feeling, yeah.

5107
04:18:07,140 --> 04:18:07,920
It does feel that way.

5108
04:18:07,920 --> 04:18:09,700
Huh, interesting.

5109
04:18:09,700 --> 04:18:15,610
What about the other side?

5110
04:18:15,610 --> 04:18:16,770
Maybe here?

5111
04:18:16,770 --> 04:18:22,680
Oh, I'm getting swept away.

5112
04:18:22,680 --> 04:18:26,440
Hmm, let me move this water flow over here.

5113
04:18:26,440 --> 04:18:28,200
Set it to water movement.

5114
04:18:28,200 --> 04:18:30,620
Where, where?

5115
04:18:30,620 --> 04:18:31,620
Here.

5116
04:18:31,620 --> 04:18:32,620
That way?

5117
04:18:32,620 --> 04:18:34,220
Heave-ho.

5118
04:18:34,220 --> 04:18:36,020
Maybe this isn't it.

5119
04:18:36,020 --> 04:18:36,820
There we go.

5120
04:18:36,820 --> 04:18:38,420
Oh, nice!

5121
04:18:38,420 --> 04:18:39,420
Hey, so like

5122
04:18:39,420 --> 04:18:41,220
there's something over there

5123
04:18:41,220 --> 04:18:43,020
looks like some stairs

5124
04:18:43,020 --> 04:18:44,020
oh yeah, yeah

5125
04:18:44,020 --> 04:18:45,020
let's go, let's go

5126
04:18:45,020 --> 04:18:46,020
thank you

5127
04:18:46,020 --> 04:18:47,020
this is it, huh

5128
04:18:47,020 --> 04:18:48,820
this is so cool

5129
04:18:48,820 --> 04:18:49,820
phew

5130
04:18:49,820 --> 04:18:50,820
feels kinda scary

5131
04:18:50,820 --> 04:18:51,620
got a good look

5132
04:18:51,620 --> 04:18:52,620
there's one here too

5133
04:18:52,620 --> 04:18:55,420
how did you even spot that

5134
04:18:55,420 --> 04:18:56,420
yeah, there's definitely something

5135
04:18:56,420 --> 04:18:57,420
wait, isn't that the exit?!

5136
04:18:57,420 --> 04:19:00,220
can't see it because of this white thing

5137
04:19:00,220 --> 04:19:02,300
nice catch, Luna! Amazing!

5138
04:19:02,300 --> 04:19:04,120
nice!

5139
04:19:04,120 --> 04:19:06,940
man, this place is hard to figure out

5140
04:19:06,940 --> 04:19:09,060
can't use this as a shortcut?

5141
04:19:09,060 --> 04:19:11,620
wait, we're still moving away?

5142
04:19:11,620 --> 04:19:13,420
what what what what

5143
04:19:13,420 --> 04:19:14,820
what?!

5144
04:19:14,820 --> 04:19:16,760
wanna do the hula hoop?

5145
04:19:16,760 --> 04:19:18,480
hula hoop, turret, hula hoop

5146
04:19:18,480 --> 04:19:19,080
warp

5147
04:19:19,080 --> 04:19:24,520
protect yourself from the turrets and hula hoop, it says

5148
04:19:24,520 --> 04:19:27,220
"protect yourself while pushing the hula hoop" — that's what it's telling us

5149
04:19:27,220 --> 04:19:31,120
there are so many turrets

5150
04:19:31,120 --> 04:19:34,020
another turret

5151
04:19:34,020 --> 04:19:36,520
ow ow ow ow ow

5152
04:19:36,520 --> 04:19:38,920
warp, remaining? there's no hula hoop!

5153
04:19:38,920 --> 04:19:41,320
what's going on? where's the hula hoop?

5154
04:19:41,320 --> 04:19:42,720
hula hoop

5155
04:19:42,720 --> 04:19:43,620
where is it?

5156
04:19:43,620 --> 04:19:47,220
can't shoot... could shoot? is this that thing

5157
04:19:47,220 --> 04:19:48,620
is this that — is it a shield?

5158
04:19:48,620 --> 04:19:49,920
it's not a shield, is it

5159
04:19:52,120 --> 04:20:00,120
you can shoot from the warp spot, right here — but without a shield you'll just get shot down

5160
04:20:00,120 --> 04:20:01,120
yeah, exactly

5161
04:20:01,120 --> 04:20:05,720
I'm about to cry

5162
04:20:05,720 --> 04:20:11,730
the turret sounds nice — no no no

5163
04:20:11,730 --> 04:20:17,560
do I have to dodge this seriously? jump? no way

5164
04:20:21,110 --> 04:20:22,910
is it below?

5165
04:20:22,910 --> 04:20:24,710
isn't the shield actually real?

5166
04:20:24,710 --> 04:20:26,710
where where where

5167
04:20:26,710 --> 04:20:28,560
shield

5168
04:20:28,560 --> 04:20:30,360
whoa, can you shoot this?

5169
04:20:30,360 --> 04:20:32,160
where was it?

5170
04:20:32,160 --> 04:20:33,960
it's this, right?

5171
04:20:33,960 --> 04:20:35,760
or not?

5172
04:20:35,760 --> 04:20:37,670
can't see it

5173
04:20:37,670 --> 04:20:39,800
this?

5174
04:20:39,800 --> 04:20:41,800
you can shoot it!

5175
04:20:41,800 --> 04:20:43,800
you can shoot it? it's way too small

5176
04:20:43,800 --> 04:20:45,810
this?

5177
04:20:45,810 --> 04:20:47,810
so it was this

5178
04:20:47,810 --> 04:20:49,810
no wonder they put a warning label on it

5179
04:20:49,810 --> 04:20:57,150
it barely protects you at all

5180
04:20:57,150 --> 04:20:59,930
like, the height is totally off, right?

5181
04:20:59,930 --> 04:21:03,370
the height just doesn't match, does it?

5182
04:21:03,370 --> 04:21:05,050
this is the only place I can go

5183
04:21:05,050 --> 04:21:06,590
what do I do? this bottom part—

5184
04:21:06,590 --> 04:21:09,390
ow ow ow ow ow ow ow

5185
04:21:09,390 --> 04:21:12,190
well it was there, but like

5186
04:21:12,190 --> 04:21:15,510
a spot to shoot from

5187
04:21:15,510 --> 04:21:21,110
there's something blue below

5188
04:21:21,110 --> 04:21:22,910
did you just build that?

5189
04:21:22,910 --> 04:21:23,910
was there something?

5190
04:21:23,910 --> 04:21:26,510
just now there was like a blue door

5191
04:21:26,510 --> 04:21:28,310
what? a door?

5192
04:21:28,310 --> 04:21:31,310
it was there, but if I just fall I'll die

5193
04:21:31,310 --> 04:21:35,310
there's one on the right too, right? there's a shooting spot on the right

5194
04:21:35,310 --> 04:21:37,910
wait, there was?

5195
04:21:37,910 --> 04:21:39,790
the shield...

5196
04:21:39,790 --> 04:21:42,510
you have to use both the shield and the warp

5197
04:21:42,510 --> 04:21:45,510
to push forward

5198
04:21:45,510 --> 04:21:51,950
where where where where?

5199
04:21:51,950 --> 04:21:54,750
it's activated, hurry up and break it!

5200
04:21:54,750 --> 04:21:55,750
break it already!

5201
04:21:55,750 --> 04:21:56,550
It really is!

5202
04:21:56,550 --> 04:21:57,550
Hurry up and crack!

5203
04:21:57,550 --> 04:21:59,350
Isn't this a warp?

5204
04:21:59,350 --> 04:22:02,350
Don't look for it— ah, Luna-san, wait, wait, wait, wait!

5205
04:22:02,350 --> 04:22:07,130
Water dog and warp

5206
04:22:07,130 --> 04:22:11,250
Po po

5207
04:22:11,250 --> 04:22:14,050
Sorry, the target, right now, it's that thing

5208
04:22:14,050 --> 04:22:18,160
Ah, sorry, where was it? And then?

5209
04:22:18,160 --> 04:22:20,160
Water dog and warp?

5210
04:22:20,160 --> 04:22:22,960
There's a white dog on its back

5211
04:22:22,960 --> 04:22:25,760
This and

5212
04:22:25,760 --> 04:22:28,560
This and warp, is that it?

5213
04:22:30,380 --> 04:22:32,380
The wall wasn't cut through

5214
04:22:32,380 --> 04:22:37,020
At this height it looks like it'd guard us

5215
04:22:37,020 --> 04:22:38,320
True

5216
04:22:38,320 --> 04:22:41,780
Ahh, I see

5217
04:22:41,780 --> 04:22:42,700
Hello

5218
04:22:42,700 --> 04:22:45,420
And then?

5219
04:22:45,420 --> 04:22:50,350
And then? Where's the next route?

5220
04:22:50,350 --> 04:22:51,590
And then? Where?

5221
04:22:51,590 --> 04:22:54,670
We're gonna get shot at like this— same as before?

5222
04:22:54,670 --> 04:22:55,950
Something like this

5223
04:22:55,950 --> 04:22:57,110
This is different, right?

5224
04:22:57,110 --> 04:22:58,010
We can shoot!

5225
04:22:58,010 --> 04:22:59,410
Ahh, we made it, we made it, we made it!

5226
04:22:59,410 --> 04:23:02,730
Oh, we made it! Getting shot, getting shot, getting shot, getting shot!

5227
04:23:02,730 --> 04:23:05,130
Oh my— shot... wait, I messed up, I'm getting shot!

5228
04:23:05,130 --> 04:23:06,350
I took it down as a bonus!

5229
04:23:06,350 --> 04:23:11,010
There was a turret there!

5230
04:23:11,010 --> 04:23:13,750
I messed up~ Turret~ Turret~

5231
04:23:13,750 --> 04:23:17,730
Shield at the rock area, got it

5232
04:23:17,730 --> 04:23:22,850
I figured it out~

5233
04:23:22,850 --> 04:23:24,750
You'd need really good eyes to manage that

5234
04:23:24,750 --> 04:23:29,150
Okay... got it. A game where you learn by dying

5235
04:23:29,850 --> 04:23:35,250
Nice, so this was actually a die-and-retry game, huh

5236
04:23:35,250 --> 04:23:40,450
Hmm? Where? Where am I now? Mumble mumble, mumble mumble

5237
04:23:40,450 --> 04:23:47,370
Okay, going down here— ow ow, huh?

5238
04:23:47,370 --> 04:23:51,120
Oh nice, like this? Where's next?

5239
04:23:51,120 --> 04:23:54,770
Wait, is this the end? Over here?

5240
04:23:54,770 --> 04:23:56,540
In here?

5241
04:23:56,540 --> 04:23:58,320
Hello?

5242
04:23:58,320 --> 04:24:00,970
It's finally here! There's a disc? Okay then—

5243
04:24:00,970 --> 04:24:03,970
Disc found!

5244
04:24:03,970 --> 04:24:07,770
Insert~ the disc~

5245
04:24:07,770 --> 04:24:13,370
One nail, this is it

5246
04:24:13,370 --> 04:24:16,170
Power has been supplied

5247
04:24:16,170 --> 04:24:19,770
Come on, open up already!

5248
04:24:22,770 --> 04:24:25,550
Come on, come on! Oh, it broke— no way!

5249
04:24:25,550 --> 04:24:29,260
It got destroyed!

5250
04:24:29,260 --> 04:24:32,640
But does this count as clearing it?

5251
04:24:32,640 --> 04:24:34,040
Probably!

5252
04:24:34,040 --> 04:24:37,740
Shouldn't the disc do something way more dramatic than that?

5253
04:24:37,740 --> 04:24:39,740
Huh? Oh, it came back! It really did!

5254
04:24:39,740 --> 04:24:42,380
Huh? Closer: Immovable Monster Creation?

5255
04:24:42,380 --> 04:24:44,500
Whoa!

5256
04:24:44,500 --> 04:24:48,700
So the 4th one is done now?

5257
04:24:50,460 --> 04:24:53,020
Mask 5th? Which number was that just now?

5258
04:24:53,020 --> 04:24:54,290
That was 4

5259
04:24:54,290 --> 04:24:58,110
So 4 is done and the next one is number 5?

5260
04:24:58,110 --> 04:25:00,700
Where the heck is number 5?

5261
04:25:00,700 --> 04:25:03,260
It's clanking like crazy

5262
04:25:03,260 --> 04:25:05,580
It's saying something, isn't it

5263
04:25:05,580 --> 04:25:07,860
What, what, what?

5264
04:25:07,860 --> 04:25:09,160
Isn't something going over the top?

5265
04:25:09,160 --> 04:25:10,040
Huh?

5266
04:25:10,040 --> 04:25:12,400
Oh, what?

5267
04:25:12,400 --> 04:25:15,780
Something about the 5th one—

5268
04:25:15,780 --> 04:25:16,740
It's being assembled right now

5269
04:25:16,740 --> 04:25:18,180
It appeared up top?

5270
04:25:18,180 --> 04:25:20,740
Ehh? How do we get there?

5271
04:25:20,740 --> 04:25:24,510
It appeared up top?

5272
04:25:24,510 --> 04:25:25,970
How do we get up there?

5273
04:25:25,970 --> 04:25:27,520
Movement Acceleration Gel

5274
04:25:27,520 --> 04:25:29,110
What kind of name is that

5275
04:25:29,110 --> 04:25:31,280
What a weird name

5276
04:25:31,280 --> 04:25:33,370
Haah~

5277
04:25:33,370 --> 04:25:34,880
Ehh?

5278
04:25:34,880 --> 04:25:35,710
Ehh?

5279
04:25:35,710 --> 04:25:36,210
How do we get there?

5280
04:25:36,210 --> 04:25:38,510
How do we get over there?

5281
04:25:38,510 --> 04:25:43,870
Oh, there's a stepping stool here!

5282
04:25:45,210 --> 04:25:49,730
Oh, this? Do we jump with this?

5283
04:25:49,730 --> 04:25:57,370
But how do we get over there? How do we get to this?

5284
04:25:57,370 --> 04:26:09,730
Do I point this downward? Oh, smart thinking! Alright, let's see if we can make it! Here we go! Yes! We did it!

5285
04:26:09,730 --> 04:26:13,120
We actually got it right!

5286
04:26:13,620 --> 04:26:18,780
It's the same as before, right? Same as the third one.

5287
04:26:18,780 --> 04:26:22,250
Dead end over here.

5288
04:26:22,250 --> 04:26:23,110
What's that?

5289
04:26:23,110 --> 04:26:23,910
Oh, it's me.

5290
04:26:23,910 --> 04:26:26,570
This feels a little different from before.

5291
04:26:26,570 --> 04:26:29,350
Isn't this old?

5292
04:26:29,350 --> 04:26:30,070
Hm?

5293
04:26:30,070 --> 04:26:30,710
I mean, look.

5294
04:26:30,710 --> 04:26:31,470
Old?

5295
04:26:31,470 --> 04:26:36,350
Wasn't it a clean, brand-new white area before?

5296
04:26:36,350 --> 04:26:37,810
Oh, you're right.

5297
04:26:37,810 --> 04:26:38,490
Whoa!

5298
04:26:38,490 --> 04:27:06,890
Whoa! It's all run-down! Like... huh? Isn't this old? We've landed in some ancient place... Wait, aren't we supposed to be cutting-edge robots? What is this? Is this the final course? It is, right? There's still more, isn't there? Where does this game even end? Are we never going to finish? I honestly have no idea. I really don't know... and seriously, this place is so old...

5299
04:27:07,690 --> 04:27:11,890
Is this an outdated model?

5300
04:27:11,890 --> 04:27:13,750
What?

5301
04:27:13,750 --> 04:27:15,970
Something about the core here...

5302
04:27:15,970 --> 04:27:16,810
Umm...

5303
04:27:16,810 --> 04:27:18,850
What is this?

5304
04:27:18,850 --> 04:27:24,230
This is completely different from everything before.

5305
04:27:24,230 --> 04:27:26,950
There's something like a lift moving.

5306
04:27:26,950 --> 04:27:31,030
Something's splattered on the back.

5307
04:27:31,030 --> 04:27:35,890
Something from above...

5308
04:27:35,890 --> 04:27:36,510
Watch over there.

5309
04:27:36,510 --> 04:27:40,310
Something like paint dripping from above...

5310
04:27:40,310 --> 04:27:41,310
What is that?

5311
04:27:41,310 --> 04:27:42,810
Let's go check it out.

5312
04:27:42,810 --> 04:27:43,510
Going in.

5313
04:27:43,510 --> 04:27:45,110
Okay.

5314
04:27:45,110 --> 04:27:50,110
Did it turn blue?

5315
04:27:50,110 --> 04:27:51,710
No, it didn't.

5316
04:27:51,710 --> 04:27:52,810
It didn't?

5317
04:27:52,810 --> 04:27:54,210
The ink just drips down, that's all.

5318
04:27:54,210 --> 04:27:56,510
Try moving around in it.

5319
04:27:56,510 --> 04:28:00,790
Nothing changes.

5320
04:28:03,310 --> 04:28:09,030
What is this? What is this ink even for?

5321
04:28:09,030 --> 04:28:11,370
What is this?

5322
04:28:11,370 --> 04:28:15,930
Oh, I can jump way higher! What?

5323
04:28:15,930 --> 04:28:23,410
So what does that mean? Maybe we ride the lift with this?

5324
04:28:23,410 --> 04:28:25,610
A platform.

5325
04:28:25,610 --> 04:28:28,730
There we go, now we can ride it.

5326
04:28:28,730 --> 04:28:29,950
Off you go!

5327
04:28:29,950 --> 04:28:34,200
Hang on... oh, there's a switch!

5328
04:28:34,200 --> 04:28:35,000
Click!

5329
04:28:35,000 --> 04:28:37,000
Where? Where is it?

5330
04:28:37,000 --> 04:28:39,000
Oh, ink burst out over there too!

5331
04:28:39,000 --> 04:28:39,100
What?! Where is it?!

5332
04:28:39,000 --> 04:29:08,590
What? Where?!

5333
04:29:08,590 --> 04:29:10,010
Something's a little...

5334
04:29:10,010 --> 04:29:10,570
Huh?

5335
04:29:10,570 --> 04:29:11,670
Wait, Oratan pressed it!

5336
04:29:11,670 --> 04:29:12,790
Oh, so that's how it works?

5337
04:29:12,790 --> 04:29:14,230
Yeah!

5338
04:29:14,230 --> 04:29:15,020
Ha!

