How about this

5381
04:32:10,440 --> 04:32:15,050
Pour ink here

5382
04:32:15,050 --> 04:32:18,910
So I pour ink here?

5383
04:32:18,910 --> 04:32:20,110
Like this

5384
04:32:20,110 --> 04:32:23,860
