5438
04:35:44,470 --> 04:35:50,870
Oh, I just need to send it through po-po style, I'm sure.

5439
04:35:50,870 --> 04:35:51,370
Huh?

5440
04:35:51,370 --> 04:35:51,870
AHHH!

5441
04:35:51,870 --> 04:35:52,370
Think we can make it?

5442
04:35:52,370 --> 04:35:52,870
Ugh...

5443
04:35:52,870 --> 04:35:56,380
What?

5444
04:35:56,380 --> 04:35:56,880
Pop!

5445
04:35:56,880 --> 04:35:58,380
I'm so bad at this!

5446
04:35:58,380 --> 04:35:58,880
Polpo, over there!

5447
04:35:58,880 --> 04:36:00,380
Looks like I can jump!

5448
04:36:00,380 --> 04:36:02,380
