5449
04:36:02,380 --> 04:36:03,380
Whoa!

5450
04:36:03,380 --> 04:36:05,180
Whoaaaa!

5451
04:36:05,180 --> 04:36:07,480
Polpo, is there one over here?

5452
04:36:07,480 --> 04:36:08,480
Hehehe

5453
04:36:08,480 --> 04:36:15,080
One person jumps, and over here we handle the switch and portal...

5454
04:36:15,080 --> 04:36:22,880
Ponpon, can you do it? The jump?

5455
04:36:22,880 --> 04:36:23,880
I got this.

5456
04:36:23,880 --> 04:36:30,460
Oh, I got swept away.

5457
04:36:30,460 --> 04:36:31,460
That's basically a warp.

5458
04:36:31,460 --> 04:36:32,460
Getting swept, getting swept.

5459
04:36:32,460 --> 04:37:06,320
Getting swept. No no no no no no!

5460
04:37:06,320 --> 04:37:09,990
There's no going backwards, right?

5461
04:37:09,990 --> 04:37:13,590
Not yet?

5462
04:37:13,590 --> 04:37:14,650
Not yet?

5463
04:37:14,650 --> 04:37:15,990
Not yet? Now?

5464
04:37:15,990 --> 04:37:18,050
Why?

5465
04:37:18,050 --> 04:37:20,210
Spawn a slime there and jump!

5466
04:37:20,210 --> 04:37:23,010
Wait, how did you even make it, Hime?

5467
04:37:23,010 --> 04:37:24,810
A running start?

5468
04:37:24,810 --> 04:37:29,280
Made it!

5469
04:37:29,280 --> 04:37:32,520
We made it!

5470
04:37:32,520 --> 04:37:33,500
Right here.

5471
04:37:33,500 --> 04:37:36,360
But if I place it here...

5472
04:37:36,360 --> 04:37:40,540
I can't shoot it to the other side.

5473
04:37:40,540 --> 04:37:43,340
Because there's a blue one there.

5474
04:37:43,340 --> 04:37:45,220
Polpo made it through.

5475
04:37:45,220 --> 04:37:47,380
So what do we do from here?

5476
04:37:47,380 --> 04:37:51,780
Even if I make a warp...

5477
04:37:51,780 --> 04:37:53,080
Oh wait, I know.

5478
04:37:53,080 --> 04:37:55,840
I messed up.

5479
04:37:55,840 --> 04:37:59,950
Carrying this won't help, will it?

5480
04:37:59,950 --> 04:38:00,550
Whoa!

5481
04:38:00,550 --> 04:38:04,950
