5482
04:38:04,950 --> 04:38:09,670
Polpo has died.

5483
04:38:09,670 --> 04:38:11,530
Don't just say "has died" like that!

5484
04:38:11,530 --> 04:38:16,350
So you do send Polpo through the door after all.

5485
04:38:16,350 --> 04:38:22,380
So how does the slime get through from here?

5486
04:38:22,380 --> 04:38:26,240
