5491
04:38:45,010 --> 04:38:47,190
I can't get in.

5492
04:38:47,190 --> 04:38:49,330
It's a perspective problem to begin with.

5493
04:39:00,810 --> 04:39:30,870
Hmm... no blue here... from here... oh wait, hold on... transport the slime... there are a lot of ideas coming up... but... places I can shoot from... can't shoot from here...

5494
04:39:30,890 --> 04:39:35,490
How am I supposed to transport it from here?

5495
04:39:35,490 --> 04:39:43,470
There's a gap up top. How do you do this?

5496
04:39:43,470 --> 04:39:47,270
Oh, bounce it from there?

5497
04:39:47,270 --> 04:39:52,070
