5498
04:39:52,070 --> 04:39:58,350
There's a shield here, you see.

5499
04:39:58,350 --> 04:39:59,970
Huh?

5500
04:39:59,970 --> 04:40:01,950
Oh wait, isn't it here?

5501
04:40:01,950 --> 04:40:06,870
On the opposite side — here and the facing side...

5502
04:40:06,870 --> 04:40:08,290
Like this.

5503
04:40:08,290 --> 04:40:14,460
What happened?

5504
04:40:14,460 --> 04:40:16,320
It totally reached the other side!

5505
04:40:16,320 --> 04:40:19,400
But it got there...

5506
04:40:19,400 --> 04:40:20,640
Can't see.

5507
04:40:20,640 --> 04:40:22,260
The Tab key.

5508
04:40:22,260 --> 04:40:23,760
Because I'm on this side.

5509
04:40:23,760 --> 04:40:25,080
Did it fly off toward the sea?

5510
04:40:25,080 --> 04:40:27,360
No no, I keep forgetting about the Tab key.

5511
04:40:27,360 --> 04:40:28,120
Right, yeah.

5512
04:40:28,120 --> 04:40:29,020
See?

5513
04:40:29,020 --> 04:40:33,570
Wait, why is this glowing blue?

5514
04:40:33,570 --> 04:40:34,020
What?

5515
04:40:34,020 --> 04:40:37,340
Something's increased.

5516
04:40:37,340 --> 04:40:46,510
I'm not sure if that's a place you can jump to or what.

5517
04:40:46,510 --> 04:40:48,550
Doesn't look like I can jump there.

5518
04:40:48,550 --> 04:40:53,220
In front of Polpo there's...

5519
04:40:53,220 --> 04:40:56,830
This...

5520
04:40:56,830 --> 04:41:01,430
If I hit that, I can jump super high?

5521
04:41:01,430 --> 04:41:04,430
So I hit the target while jumping?

5522
04:41:04,430 --> 04:41:05,230
That's right.

5523
04:41:05,230 --> 04:41:06,030
Oh, it got mad.

5524
04:41:06,030 --> 04:41:07,030
Oh, it's okay.

5525
04:41:07,030 --> 04:41:10,830
The blue ones stay.

5526
04:41:10,830 --> 04:41:25,920
Like this.

5527
04:41:25,920 --> 04:41:32,770
Heave-ho.

5528
04:41:32,770 --> 04:41:34,570
Isn't this hard?

5529
04:41:35,830 --> 04:41:39,830
It feels totally different from everything before, doesn't it?

5530
04:41:39,830 --> 04:41:42,630
The difficulty has gone up a bit.

5531
04:41:42,630 --> 04:41:46,430
The difficulty has gone up.

5532
04:41:46,430 --> 04:41:50,560
What exactly am I supposed to do here?

5533
04:41:50,560 --> 04:41:52,560
Right?

5534
04:41:52,560 --> 04:41:57,360
Because of this barrier, I can't really do what I want.

5535
04:41:57,360 --> 04:42:01,160
I've gotta do something here.

5536
04:42:06,340 --> 04:42:07,640
Oh wait, Ponpon!

5537
04:42:07,640 --> 04:42:08,640
What's up?

5538
04:42:08,640 --> 04:42:09,840
Oh, but in—

5539
04:42:09,840 --> 04:42:13,140
Ponpon, make a warp here.

5540
04:42:13,140 --> 04:42:13,940
Yeah, I did it.

5541
04:42:13,940 --> 04:42:14,800
Hm?

5542
04:42:14,800 --> 04:42:16,240
Here and here.

5543
04:42:16,240 --> 04:42:18,440
I'm waiting.

5544
04:42:18,440 --> 04:42:21,240
For that, Polka has no choice but to succeed at the jump challenge.

5545
04:42:21,240 --> 04:42:22,240
Here we go!

5546
04:42:22,240 --> 04:42:23,840
No, you don't need to jump — over here.

5547
04:42:23,840 --> 04:42:24,740
Wait, seriously?

5548
04:42:24,740 --> 04:42:25,740
Okay!

5549
04:42:25,740 --> 04:42:28,640
Sometimes you don't need to jump!

5550
04:42:28,640 --> 04:42:29,740
Ponpon does this part,

5551
04:42:29,740 --> 04:42:32,040
and Unatан incorporates from here—

5552
04:42:32,040 --> 04:42:33,540
goes Po—

5553
04:42:33,540 --> 04:42:36,540
from here, go Po— will it go Po?

5554
04:42:36,540 --> 04:42:38,340
Po with a Po?

5555
04:42:38,340 --> 04:42:39,340
Here...

5556
04:42:39,340 --> 04:42:42,140
Um, the warp...

5557
04:42:42,140 --> 04:42:47,200
Here and here.

5558
04:42:47,200 --> 04:42:51,800
Warp here...

5559
04:42:51,800 --> 04:42:55,510
And then here and...

5560
04:42:55,510 --> 04:42:58,390
here.

5561
04:42:58,390 --> 04:43:00,190
And like this...

5562
04:43:01,390 --> 04:43:03,390
It warped somewhere.

5563
04:43:03,390 --> 04:43:06,390
The ink is moving.

5564
04:43:06,390 --> 04:43:09,190
It went upward, right?

5565
04:43:09,190 --> 04:43:10,990
Does this open, by the way?

5566
04:43:10,990 --> 04:43:11,990
It doesn't open.

5567
04:43:11,990 --> 04:43:18,460
And what does that mean for us?

5568
04:43:18,460 --> 04:43:22,390
It's getting more and more splattered, but...

5569
04:43:22,390 --> 04:43:26,390
Maybe we're supposed to do something with the splattered jump.

5570
04:43:26,390 --> 04:43:29,190
Where the splatter lands,

5571
04:43:29,190 --> 04:43:30,990
do we go there?

5572
04:43:30,990 --> 04:43:34,790
Oh, we use this to cancel the Po-Po warp.

5573
04:43:34,790 --> 04:43:36,590
The one below, here.

5574
04:43:36,590 --> 04:43:37,390
Okay.

5575
04:43:37,390 --> 04:43:38,990
Um—

5576
04:43:38,990 --> 04:43:44,790
By cancel, I mean, Unatан shoots the ink,

5577
04:43:44,790 --> 04:43:52,590
and when the ink reaches the middle, cancel here and drop the ink that went up back down.

5578
04:43:52,590 --> 04:43:56,040
O-okay.

5579
04:43:56,040 --> 04:43:57,840
Let's try it.

5580
04:43:57,840 --> 04:43:59,840
Add some ink.

5581
04:43:59,840 --> 04:44:01,840
Ink, go!

5582
04:44:01,840 --> 04:44:04,640
Oh, sorry, I forgot to cancel.

5583
04:44:04,640 --> 04:44:06,440
Ink go, please!

5584
04:44:06,440 --> 04:44:09,240
Let's try again — go!

5585
04:44:09,240 --> 04:44:12,840
It's mad, it's mad, it's mad!

5586
04:44:12,840 --> 04:44:15,840
The ink dripped a ton!

5587
04:44:15,840 --> 04:44:21,770
Now warp with this and go over there.

5588
04:44:26,740 --> 04:44:28,500
This time we warp over.

5589
04:44:28,500 --> 04:44:30,390
Wait, how do we warp there?

5590
04:44:30,390 --> 04:44:32,190
With the ink?

5591
04:44:32,190 --> 04:44:34,420
Huh? And then?

5592
04:44:34,420 --> 04:44:36,220
Wait, here—

5593
04:44:36,220 --> 04:44:38,220
I'll drip ink over here too.

5594
04:44:38,220 --> 04:44:42,020
How are we supposed to warp there?

5595
04:44:42,020 --> 04:44:44,020
Haven't you dripped ink over there too?

5596
04:44:44,020 --> 04:44:49,740
Over there, the angle—

5597
04:44:49,740 --> 04:44:51,740
That's not possible.

5598
04:44:51,740 --> 04:44:54,740
There's no barrier there, so we can't get through.

5599
04:44:54,740 --> 04:44:58,540
I'm bad at jumping, so I wanted you here too.

5600
04:44:58,540 --> 04:45:02,340
Oh come on! We did jump though!

5601
04:45:02,340 --> 04:45:10,140
But what are you even trying to do with all these parakeets?

5602
04:45:10,140 --> 04:45:12,940
Maybe it jumped over to the other side?

5603
04:45:12,940 --> 04:45:50,030
Boing boing boing!

5604
04:45:50,030 --> 04:45:52,030
Oh, so you ride it like this!

5605
04:45:52,030 --> 04:45:56,090
I couldn't make a warp here, huh.

5606
04:45:56,090 --> 04:46:09,280
Wait, warp the ink to the front?

5607
04:46:09,280 --> 04:46:15,680
Huh? Can you even place it there?

5608
04:46:15,680 --> 04:46:21,100
Wait, right now—

5609
04:46:21,100 --> 04:46:23,240
Oh, you can place it there?

5610
04:46:23,240 --> 04:46:28,560
