05:00:34,850 --> 05:00:37,310
Probably here.

5856
05:00:37,310 --> 05:00:38,870
Probably this...

5857
05:00:38,870 --> 05:00:40,870
Isn't it a jam wave?

5858
05:00:40,870 --> 05:00:43,210
On top of this platform,

5859
05:00:43,210 --> 05:00:47,660
you drop it onto the platform?

5860
05:00:47,660 --> 05:00:49,820
Well, it's more like a path than a platform.

5861
05:00:49,820 --> 05:01:11,090
There's also a vertical one here,

5862
05:01:11,090 --> 05:01:14,190
so maybe you arrange them vertically instead of horizontally?

5863
05:01:14,590 --> 05:01:18,390
It seems like it has infinite possibilities.

5864
05:01:18,390 --> 05:01:22,190
Yeah, it feels like it does.

5865
05:01:22,190 --> 05:01:33,370
Where should I start building?

5866
05:01:33,370 --> 05:01:38,680
First, there.

5867
05:01:38,680 --> 05:01:39,680
In red.

5868
05:01:39,680 --> 05:01:41,480
Like this.

5869
05:01:41,480 --> 05:01:46,740
What if it's like this?

5870
05:01:46,740 --> 05:01:51,340
Do this, and... maybe here?

5871
05:01:51,340 --> 05:01:57,010
Oh, it's pouring out!

5872
05:01:57,010 --> 05:01:57,810
But if this gets removed...

5873
05:01:57,810 --> 05:01:59,810
Oh, can't you jump over to it?

5874
05:01:59,810 --> 05:02:00,610
To the exit?

5875
05:02:00,610 --> 05:02:01,410
No way?

5876
05:02:01,410 --> 05:02:02,410
Yeah.

5877
05:02:02,410 --> 05:02:05,210
Can't make it?

5878
05:02:05,210 --> 05:02:07,010
Huh? Heave-ho.

5879
05:02:07,010 --> 05:02:08,810
Oh, I got on!

5880
05:02:08,810 --> 05:02:10,610
We made it, nice!

5881
05:02:10,610 --> 05:02:12,410
Huh?

5882
05:02:12,410 --> 05:02:13,210
So it's like this?

5883
05:02:13,210 --> 05:02:14,210
Why?

5884
05:02:15,010 --> 05:02:23,340
Wait, what is this? Like an entrance?

5885
05:02:23,340 --> 05:02:26,860
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, I see, I see.

5886
05:02:26,860 --> 05:02:29,840
Mm-hmm, mm-hmm, mm-hmm.

5887
05:02:29,840 --> 05:02:33,300
Oh, there's something here again.

5888
05:02:33,300 --> 05:02:37,880
Oh, really! Connect it, connect it!

5889
05:02:37,880 --> 05:02:42,380
Okay, okay, what happens if we do this?

5890
05:02:42,380 --> 05:02:47,600
Way in the back — is this Luna's next?

5891
05:02:47,600 --> 05:02:53,980
Where did it come from? Where did it come from? It's somewhere in the back over there — yeah, it's in the back.

5892
05:02:53,980 --> 05:02:59,200
It's Luna's turn next. Luna, please go ahead.

5893
05:02:59,200 --> 05:03:02,200
How do you get up here? Oh!

5894
05:03:02,200 --> 05:03:09,370
It's over that way, so Luna needs to get past this barrier.

5895
05:03:09,730 --> 05:03:12,790
Can she get past the barrier?

5896
05:03:12,790 --> 05:03:16,030
Go this way,

5897
05:03:16,030 --> 05:03:20,490
and Luna probably has to shoot it or it won't work.

5898
05:03:20,490 --> 05:03:24,030
Go like this,

5899
05:03:24,030 --> 05:03:27,050
and then try pressing it? Then...

5900
05:03:27,050 --> 05:03:31,030
Oh wait, you can jump here.

5901
05:03:31,030 --> 05:03:36,660
Can you jump and land on it?

5902
05:03:36,660 --> 05:03:38,300
Remove it?

5903
05:03:39,020 --> 05:03:43,790
Where's the right spot?

5904
05:03:43,790 --> 05:03:49,390
Oh, it fell down here.

5905
05:03:49,390 --> 05:03:51,190
Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.

5906
05:03:51,190 --> 05:03:54,790
Jump from here — oh, is this the way up?

5907
05:03:54,790 --> 05:03:55,790
Can't you reach it?

5908
05:03:55,790 --> 05:04:02,390
The exit is over that way, right?

5909
05:04:02,390 --> 05:04:05,330
There's the exit — it was above that jump!

5910
05:04:05,330 --> 05:04:08,110
So jump on top of this board?

5911
05:04:08,110 --> 05:04:12,290
It's not a board, there's like a floor there.

5912
05:04:12,290 --> 05:04:17,390
I saw that floor, but can't you just jump on top of this shield?

5913
05:04:17,390 --> 05:04:20,330
For the jump.

5914
05:04:20,330 --> 05:04:23,930
That's true!

5915
05:04:23,930 --> 05:04:27,520
Oh, we made it!

5916
05:04:27,520 --> 05:04:29,330
What do we do now?

5917
05:04:29,330 --> 05:04:34,930
After this, Polka's path is coming up.

5918
05:04:34,930 --> 05:04:44,020
Oh, maybe Unatan is making a path on this side and that side?

5919
05:04:44,020 --> 05:04:47,620
Wait, Polka's safe spot is...

5920
05:04:47,620 --> 05:04:49,620
Umm...

5921
05:04:49,620 --> 05:04:54,390
It's like barely...

5922
05:04:54,390 --> 05:04:58,250
There's a barrier here too, right?

5923
05:05:02,360 --> 05:05:04,360
How do I get through here?

5924
05:05:04,360 --> 05:05:08,240
Wait, huh?

5925
05:05:08,240 --> 05:05:10,040
Heeey~

5926
05:05:10,040 --> 05:05:14,020
Oh, can I get through?!

5927
05:05:14,020 --> 05:05:15,810
Oh, I made it!

5928
05:05:15,810 --> 05:05:17,620
Popo made it!

5929
05:05:17,620 --> 05:05:19,370
Huh? How?

5930
05:05:19,370 --> 05:05:21,370
Go forward, forward, then go right there

5931
05:05:21,370 --> 05:05:24,970
And then, Popo—

5932
05:05:24,970 --> 05:05:26,970
Go right — which right?

5933
05:05:28,770 --> 05:05:31,770
Huh? Just keep going straight

5934
05:05:31,770 --> 05:05:34,570
Oh, but it's cut off here

5935
05:05:34,570 --> 05:05:36,570
Can't you shoot from there?

5936
05:05:36,570 --> 05:05:42,210
Huh? How did I get through before?

5937
05:05:42,210 --> 05:05:45,010
It's broken off

5938
05:05:45,010 --> 05:05:55,200
Ah, that didn't work

5939
05:05:55,200 --> 05:05:56,200
Huh? How do I get through here?

5940
05:05:56,200 --> 05:05:58,200
How do I get to Popo?

5941
05:06:00,800 --> 05:06:03,300
Huh? There's no shortcut, right?

5942
05:06:03,300 --> 05:06:04,800
Oh, what about this?

5943
05:06:04,800 --> 05:06:06,900
Oh? Hold on a sec

5944
05:06:06,900 --> 05:06:07,700
Did something happen? A shortcut?

5945
05:06:07,700 --> 05:06:09,200
There's no wave, right?

5946
05:06:09,200 --> 05:06:10,500
Hmm...

5947
05:06:10,500 --> 05:06:12,800
Ah! Looks like I can make it!

5948
05:06:12,800 --> 05:06:13,600
Nope, can't!

5949
05:06:13,600 --> 05:06:15,100
No no no no no no!

5950
05:06:15,100 --> 05:06:16,100
Ah, wait

5951
05:06:16,100 --> 05:06:20,500
Wait wait wait, Ponpon wait!

5952
05:06:20,500 --> 05:06:22,300
It's fine it's fine — how do we get there?

5953
05:06:22,300 --> 05:06:23,300
I'm waiting

5954
05:06:23,300 --> 05:06:27,900
Huh? Is it this?

5955
05:06:27,900 --> 05:06:29,660
Huh? What am I supposed to do here?

5956
05:06:29,660 --> 05:06:32,930
With this...

5957
05:06:32,930 --> 05:06:36,390
This is just a vertical line, right?

5958
05:06:36,390 --> 05:06:39,740
Hmm?

5959
05:06:39,740 --> 05:06:42,620
So we're not going this way?

5960
05:06:42,620 --> 05:06:47,350
Wait, I get it... huh? Wait

5961
05:06:47,350 --> 05:06:50,630
This goes toward me too...

5962
05:06:50,630 --> 05:06:51,950
From here...

5963
05:06:51,950 --> 05:06:55,310
Huh? But I can see Luna over there

5964
05:06:55,310 --> 05:06:57,210
Like this

5965
05:06:59,720 --> 05:07:07,600
It's a straight shot over there, but there's no ink so I can't jump

5966
05:07:07,600 --> 05:07:10,520
Where is the ink?

5967
05:07:10,520 --> 05:07:15,400
The ink is back at the very start

5968
05:07:15,400 --> 05:07:19,690
So isn't it impossible then?

5969
05:07:19,690 --> 05:07:25,290
Oh, then Popo goes ahead and makes a path over here first

5970
05:07:25,290 --> 05:07:27,730
The path Popo is walking on right now—

5971
05:07:27,730 --> 05:07:29,730
Can you walk over while laying down ink?

5972
05:07:29,730 --> 05:07:30,530
Huh?

5973
05:07:30,530 --> 05:07:33,530
I don't get how the ink works

5974
05:07:33,530 --> 05:07:36,130
How does the ink...

5975
05:07:36,130 --> 05:07:39,890
Polka...

5976
05:07:39,890 --> 05:07:41,730
Polka makes it?

5977
05:07:41,730 --> 05:07:42,730
I make the path...

5978
05:07:42,730 --> 05:07:43,730
I make the path?

5979
05:07:43,730 --> 05:07:46,730
You came all this way without understanding how the ink works

5980
05:07:46,730 --> 05:07:47,730
It's fine

5981
05:07:47,730 --> 05:07:48,730
Where do I...

5982
05:07:48,730 --> 05:07:51,730
Where do I put down ink in this?

5983
05:07:51,730 --> 05:07:54,740
But it's impossible

5984
05:07:54,740 --> 05:07:56,740
Even if one of us puts it down, isn't it still impossible?

5985
05:07:56,740 --> 05:08:04,470
The ink button

5986
05:08:04,470 --> 05:08:08,470
The ink — ink, ink, ink — where is it?

5987
05:08:08,470 --> 05:08:11,070
I'm pressing this right now

5988
05:08:11,070 --> 05:08:13,070
Oh, it's over there

5989
05:08:13,070 --> 05:08:17,580
I see, wait huh?

5990
05:08:17,580 --> 05:08:20,400
Does it disappear after a while? This?

5991
05:08:20,400 --> 05:08:25,840
But that way... hmm

5992
05:08:25,840 --> 05:08:32,040
Oh, if Popo makes the path—

5993
05:08:32,040 --> 05:08:33,820
There's no path

5994
05:08:33,820 --> 05:08:37,580
Because there's a barrier on this side

5995
05:08:37,580 --> 05:08:44,970
I can't make one, you see

5996
05:08:44,970 --> 05:08:49,200
Hm? Wait

5997
05:08:49,560 --> 05:08:53,660
It's like... oh sorry

5998
05:08:53,660 --> 05:08:57,200
Hold on, so it goes like this, right?

5999
05:08:57,200 --> 05:09:02,260
And Popo goes down that path

6000
05:09:02,260 --> 05:09:07,040
And then left... wait, there's a gap...

6001
05:09:07,040 --> 05:09:11,900
I see, so you don't punch through it...

6002
05:09:11,900 --> 05:09:15,620
Hmm, what do I do? What do I do?

6003
05:09:15,620 --> 05:09:23,380
Umm? I want to drip some ink!

6004
05:09:23,380 --> 05:09:34,010
Drip the ink... ah! I reached it! Sorry, I solved it on my own! Wait, ink is coming out! Why? I somehow managed it on my own!

6005
05:09:34,010 --> 05:09:43,410
I forced my way through! Hey! It worked?! I somehow made it! My arms were longer than I thought! Why is the ink dripping?!

6006
05:09:43,410 --> 05:09:45,410
I don't really get it, but it worked.

6007
05:09:45,410 --> 05:09:47,410
My arms were longer than expected.

6008
05:09:47,410 --> 05:09:49,210
I managed to account for it.

6009
05:09:49,210 --> 05:09:51,010
I did account for it.

6010
05:09:51,010 --> 05:09:55,010
What on earth just happened there?

6011
05:09:55,010 --> 05:10:02,580
Turns out there are ways to succeed that aren't the intended method.

6012
05:10:02,580 --> 05:10:03,380
Right.

6013
05:10:03,380 --> 05:10:06,380
Well, I'm not even sure if what I just did counts as the right way either.

6014
05:10:06,380 --> 05:10:10,180
4.

6015
05:10:12,180 --> 05:10:13,940
Time to get that ink out!

6016
05:10:13,940 --> 05:10:16,960
I thought it ended at stage 5, but it doesn't?

6017
05:10:16,960 --> 05:10:19,060
There are actually 8 stages.

6018
05:10:19,060 --> 05:10:21,400
There are 8 of these?

6019
05:10:21,400 --> 05:10:23,420
Should we take a break for now?

6020
05:10:23,420 --> 05:10:25,900
Yeah, it's been a while.

6021
05:10:25,900 --> 05:10:28,920
Mm-hmm.

6022
05:10:28,920 --> 05:10:30,920
This is getting fun.

6023
05:10:30,920 --> 05:10:32,920
Oh, uh, want to keep going? We can keep going!

6024
05:10:32,920 --> 05:10:35,820
Nah, it's already midnight, let's stop for now.

6025
05:10:35,820 --> 05:10:36,660
Alright, let's stop then.

6026
05:10:36,660 --> 05:10:39,400
Shall we make this our last adventure, or save it for next time?

6027
05:10:39,400 --> 05:10:39,900
Probably.

6028
05:10:39,900 --> 05:10:41,100
Let's set a time for next time.

6029
05:10:41,100 --> 05:10:49,160
I mean, even stage 5 might not be the end — isn't that still uncertain? Like, these gimmicks...

6030
05:10:49,160 --> 05:10:54,490
It feels like we've finally come this far, so I really don't know.

6031
05:10:54,490 --> 05:10:58,260
Yeah, I'm kind of watching to see.

6032
05:10:58,260 --> 05:11:02,880
Next time, let's make sure not to forget about the ink mechanic.

6033
05:11:02,880 --> 05:11:08,320
Right, let's leave it here for today. And also remember the warp stuff too.

6034
05:11:08,320 --> 05:11:10,720
Yeah, I'll watch the archive and remind myself.

6035
05:11:10,720 --> 05:11:12,960
It's before Fes Expo for us too, after all.

6036
05:11:12,960 --> 05:11:15,120
We'll end up just goofing around like this forever.

6037
05:11:15,120 --> 05:11:17,220
Hahahahaha.

6038
05:11:17,220 --> 05:11:18,720
-Surprisingly, yeah. -So, on that note.

6039
05:11:18,720 --> 05:11:21,120
Alright, since we're starting to have too much fun—

6040
05:11:21,120 --> 05:11:22,620
Queen.

6041
05:11:22,620 --> 05:11:25,420
I see, this game has real character.

6042
05:11:25,420 --> 05:11:27,420
Phew~

6043
05:11:27,420 --> 05:11:29,120
I'm mentally exhausted from all that thinking.

6044
05:11:29,120 --> 05:11:30,820
"Mentally exhausted" lol.

6045
05:11:30,820 --> 05:11:32,320
Phew~

6046
05:11:32,320 --> 05:11:37,080
Alright, we'll continue next time!

6047
05:11:37,080 --> 05:11:39,440
After Holo Fes Expo, right?

6048
05:11:39,440 --> 05:11:41,400
Thanks everyone for sticking around so long!

6049
05:11:41,400 --> 05:11:43,020
Thanks to Luna too!

6050
05:11:43,020 --> 05:11:45,440
Thankyu~

6051
05:11:45,440 --> 05:11:46,620
Alright then—

6052
05:11:46,620 --> 05:11:49,160
Let's close out with an Otsupoluna!

6053
05:11:49,160 --> 05:11:51,890
Okay!

6054
05:11:51,890 --> 05:11:53,160
Ready, go—

6055
05:11:53,160 --> 05:11:57,700
Otsupoluna ending!

6056
05:12:02,100 --> 05:12:04,520
Heave-ho, heave-ho, heave-ho!
